{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/56bf33ec3948493007f44dc13c5a9a18.avif?t=1761065738\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience life as a vampire in the magical town of <strong>Moonlight Peaks</strong>! In this heartwarming life-sim, you set out to prove to your skeptical father, Count Dracula, that a life of compassion is possible - even for the undead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the local werewolves, witches and mermaids, and find your eternal love in the supernatural dating scene. Embrace immortality and unlock ancient powers, brew potions, and cast spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of the seven families that inhabit Moonlight Peaks and step out of your father's shadow. Your legacy as a Dracula is yours to create!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/05d7c670b920bcd6bb3f1d3af86dfa38.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Moonlight Peaks, the dating pool is full of options. Find your perfect match among a diverse crowd that runs the gamut from werewolves to humans. You might even decide to spend eternity together... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/ded82ae14b24966ccdb4a64d80b11fdd.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=1402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/3824279082b3de5171c5c484a1ed8700.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tend to a cozy farm filled with magical crops and glowing flowers! As a vampire, you subsist on enchanted food, so tending your garden is more than a passion\u2014it's part of your everyday routine. Bewitch your tools and watch your crops flourish on their own...and don't forget to give your Draculambs a well-earned pet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d0ba44ee1d3b2697941bd32caa9cccc0.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d0ba44ee1d3b2697941bd32caa9cccc0.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d0ba44ee1d3b2697941bd32caa9cccc0.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/4dd1a66e3af08f825cbb0f0182581471.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of customization options to create a character that truly represents who you are. As you progress in the game, you'll unlock powerful vampiric abilities, allowing you to take on the characteristics of your immortal ancestors. From heightened senses to full-on shapeshifting, these powers will make every day in Moonlight Peaks an adventure to remember. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/beb52ab653367e15f210e5f0b2a8fd45.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/beb52ab653367e15f210e5f0b2a8fd45.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/beb52ab653367e15f210e5f0b2a8fd45.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/c7ad64dd8990537ff672392cbddb49cd.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own vampire paradise\u2014a sanctuary that reflects your gothic taste. Select the perfect coffin and craft eerie decorations to give your home a touch of the macabre. With the ability to expand your farm plot and upgrade your house, the possibilities are endless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/ba7cfd06f62f7d8b7898bbf0dc5b7e68.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/ba7cfd06f62f7d8b7898bbf0dc5b7e68.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/ba7cfd06f62f7d8b7898bbf0dc5b7e68.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/e80893220e04d99cc0f4ab8d547ca800.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Moonlight Peaks, the arts of potion-making and spellcasting are essential parts of everyday life. Learn from local witches as you study spells, experiment with rare ingredients, and brew powerful potions to aid you on your journey.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/da20e92af48c864e5fdae0b099bd5a44.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/da20e92af48c864e5fdae0b099bd5a44.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/da20e92af48c864e5fdae0b099bd5a44.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/33c4502634dfd18f5be2a51314fe3630.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant and mysterious world where the supernatural is the norm. Gather magical ingredients, prepare enchanted meals, and participate in seasonal events. Use your shapeshifting abilities to uncover hidden nooks where ancient secrets lie waiting. From lively village streets to mist-shrouded forests, discover a realm teeming with wonder and intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/1f2e37530efb8a0ef069995d028b5ec3.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/1f2e37530efb8a0ef069995d028b5ec3.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/1f2e37530efb8a0ef069995d028b5ec3.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/0dbc6190e2b13700650c9dad3d7d08c7.webp?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your adventure with charming activities like making pottery, arranging flowers, and playing the violin for your animals. Whether it's mastering Nokturna\u2014the local card game\u2014or competing in Moonlight Peaks' yearly cook-off, there's always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d1c199abec899c28dbaaf7a6ce84dd68.poster.avif?t=1761065738\" width=604 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d1c199abec899c28dbaaf7a6ce84dd68.webm?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/extras/d1c199abec899c28dbaaf7a6ce84dd68.mp4?t=1761065738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2209900?t=1761065738","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2209900?t=1761065738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/6f0a16e68608089383a80a5ac26d0e8f04833fb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761065738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209900/6f0a16e68608089383a80a5ac26d0e8f04833fb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761065738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller s